# Acme Results
**Acme Manufacturing | quarterly operating review, 2022–2026**

Amounts in $000 except unit and headcount measures. The 2026 fourth quarter is the latest management close; earlier periods are retained for trend analysis.

Service renewals and replacement-part sales are supporting margin expansion. Procurement is reviewing the increased component commitment ahead of the next production cycle.

