**Management follow-up**

1. Confirm service-renewal capacity before increasing the installed-base target.
2. Review capital spending alongside cash conversion, rather than operating profit alone.
3. Monitor warranty claims as the new systems enter their second year in service.

# Annual Review
**Five-year performance bridge**

Quarterly management accounts are consolidated below. Revenue growth reflects the shift toward recurring service work, while capital expenditure supports capacity rather than acquisitions.

